msgid "Seconds to wait after Kodi starts"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#32168"
msgid "How long after Kodi starts before this add-on does anything: the watch history, ratings and collection art syncs that run at start-up, and the check for items Chronicle says changed. Raise it if your network drives need longer to mount, or lower it to 0 to start straight away. Default 10 seconds. It cannot delay Kodi's own start-up library scan, which Kodi runs on its own schedule."
msgstr ""
